{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Peter at Work", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Grand Ferdinand ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Grammar - part 3 > The Suitcase", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Showing Interest and Enthusiasm", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "One way to keep a conversation going is to show the speaker that you are listening to what is being said.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Below you will find useful ways to be an active listener and keep the conversation going. The \u201cgood news\u201d is that you actually don't need many words in order to do this.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Showing Interest</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Excellent!</li><li>Really? <span class =\\\"italic\\\">(with a rising intonation)</span></li><li>Is that so?</li><li>Terrific!</li><li>I'm looking forward to ...  <span class =\\\"italic\\\">(use \u2018-ing')</span></li><li>I think you did a nice/great job on ... /with ... </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Using a short phrase to show your feelings</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Believe me ... </li><li>How awful!</li><li>Oh no!</li><li>You're kidding.</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Ask a short question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use an auxiliary verb to ask a short question which will prompt the speaker to continue talking.<br/><ul><li>I'm going away next week. &#8594; Oh, are you?</li><li>I finished the report. &#8594; Did you?</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Jane</span>: I'm presenting the report tomorrow.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Shawn</span>: <span class=\"strong\">Oh, really?</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Jane</span>: Yes. I got the confirmation today.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Shawn</span>: <span class=\"strong\">I'm looking forward to</span> being there.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Working in a Team", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Praising co-workers and employees when they are doing good work can make a positive impact on the workplace.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here are a few phrases you can use to praise a subordinate on their performance and a bring smile, good cheer and better commitment to their job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>That is why I recommended/suggested you.</li><li>You have excellent client rapport/computer skills. </li><li>Your enthusiasm/work is first class.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We normally use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Simple</span>, <span class=\"strong\">Past Simple</span> or <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> when praising. Here are some more phrases.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Praising</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>Thanks for all your help. </li><li>Thanks for everything you've done. </li><li>Thanks a million. </li><li>I owe you big time. </li><li>I really appreciate your help (with that). </li><li>You've been very helpful. </li><li>Keep up the good work.</li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "press conference", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an event for the media to gather to hear an announcement and ask questions", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have experience in arranging press conferences.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear when at work.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "staging", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to prepare, arrange and present a public event", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have experience in staging and sponsoring special events.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pour good money into", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to spend a large amount of money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Non-traditional PR events are definitely something to pour some good money into. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "coverage", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the extent of the area the business reaches", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My dream is to help give our business the coverage it deserves in South America.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "first class", "type": "name"}, {"content": "of the highest quality", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your enthusiasm is first class. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pat on the back", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to give praise and appreciation", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can give yourself a pat on the back for your dedication.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Read the situation below. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose the role you want. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice talking about the situation in the role play. Continue speaking for as long as you can.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Then, switch roles with your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"underline\\\">Situation:</span><br/><br/>  Role 1: You are a manager. You have a meeting with one of your employees. Praise them for the good work they are doing. Show enthusiasm while talking to them.<br/><br/>  Role 2: You are an employee. You have a meeting with your manager. Respond to the praise they are giving you. Show interest and enthusiasm while talking to them. <br/><br/>  Change  roles.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I praise an employee for their work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I show interest and enthusiasm to keep a conversation going. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I respond to praise that  I receive. ", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "R