id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn6le14ob02re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Good to see you, Miranda. So, it's 1:15. Where is Ferdinand? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: He'll be coming. I think ...\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Ladies! My apologies. I'm a bit late. I just met the concierge in the elevator. A friendly chap. He wanted to show me the greenery plans on the mezzanine.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn6le14ob02re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Always personable, Ferdinand. That is why I recommended you to Janet. You have excellent client rapport and have been very helpful. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Thank you. Hopefully with my employers as well. I am looking forward to being of service in a new role! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Excellent. Ferdinand, we are working on a proposal to expand into online retail, specifically in the South American market. You are here not only because of your cultural expertise but your skillful rapport with clients as well. How would you feel with a main PR role? We were thinking of something less traditional than we've been doing.", "id": 2, "time": "18700", "image": "engenn6le14ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Are you? Terrific! I have experience in arranging press conferences, staging and sponsoring events ... this is definitely something to pour some good money into. Believe me, you won't be sorry. To help give your business the coverage it deserves, especially in South America, is a dream of mine. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Your enthusiasm is first class. I think we will partner you with Rocco. He is excellent with finances. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: You can give yourself a pat on the back, Ferdinand. Keep up the good work! We really appreciate your dedication.", "id": 3, "time": "57500", "image": "engenn6le14ob02re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le14ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le14ob02re2img07.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}